WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.590
Press one sharp nail hard into
skin, and it can break through.

2
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.940
Yet a performer can lie down
on a board packed with nails,

3
00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:10.080
and stand up again unhurt.

4
00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:11.110
Same body.

5
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.720
Same sharp points.

6
00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:14.750
A very different result.

7
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.830
Why is the bed safe, when
one nail on its own is not?

8
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:23.430
In this mission, you'll find out why
only part of a slanted push counts.

9
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:28.180
Then you'll zoom in on a gas, where
countless tiny collisions add up to a steady

10
00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.200
push on every wall.

11
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.610
Your mission: explain why
the bed of nails is safe,

12
00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.470
and the single nail is not.
